@startuml
title Resource Request Processing Flow

participant Client
participant WebproxyServer
participant Database
participant Cluster

Client->WebproxyServer: Send subscription request
WebproxyServer->Database: Authenticate user
Database->WebproxyServer: User authenticated
WebproxyServer->Cluster: Join cluster
Cluster->WebproxyServer: Cluster joined
WebproxyServer->WebproxyServer: Add resource to pending queue
WebproxyServer->Database: Store pending resource
Database->WebproxyServer: Resource stored
WebproxyServer->Cluster: Broadcast resource request
Cluster->WebproxyServer: Notify peers
WebproxyServer->Peer: Send resource petition
Peer->WebproxyServer: Confirm resource request
WebproxyServer->Database: Remove pending resource
Database->WebproxyServer: Resource removed

@enduml
